{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0189_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0189_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "c2659503eec57233f45d032f30c8d2681b432c25bb75a8105ca103b184c53e16", "ja": "温室と亡霊", "zh": "温室与亡灵", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0189_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0189_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "94d470b504299f6f9fd12a3e807d50e63214a00e1d766fe69ce83df28d0f2d5b", "ja": "紬に手を焼く桃子だが、友人のこのみから\n美奈子と紬がアルメリア妹の席を争っていた\nと聞かされる。一方そのころ、温室にいる\n美奈子と恵美の前に現れた紬は、「あなたを\n許しません」と言葉を残し立ち去る。", "zh": "桃子被紬弄得很是头疼，这时从朋友此乃美那里听说，美奈子和紬曾为争夺阿尔梅利亚妹妹的位置而竞争。与此同时，出现在温室里的紬对美奈子和惠美留下“我不会原谅你”这句话后便离开了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0189_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0189_story_02_1000_null", "source_sha256": "de032b14ad770092a08e64ee0b7359b1bdf150548e5d96e8eacb1487cc8ae481", "ja": "翌日……", "zh": "隔天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0189_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0189_story_02_1001_049mom", "source_sha256": "869ef037d6c929a0305fa85eeccdedc9bb644e944637ca1694da0f0102f8f3be", "ja": "もう……何なの、あの子！\n最初は、感じの良さそうな子だと思ったのに！", "zh": "真是的……那孩子到底是怎么回事！\n明明一开始还觉得她是个看起来挺不错的人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0189_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0189_story_02_1002_049mom", "source_sha256": "b27d4b146e8c6ea37838fe5e9f3733298dd8b4086a573265be382ec8bf1f34a2", "ja": "けど、シスター歌織によろしくって言われてるし。\n今日の昼休みも、いろいろ案内しないと……はぁ。", "zh": "可是，歌织修女还拜托我照顾她。今天午休也得带她到处逛逛……唉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0189_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0189_story_02_1003_049mom", "source_sha256": "0a379ffd81b88dd66558a3e3e574218c6c6294f3811c39751dbc4d57f77565e0", "ja": "あ、あの、紬……さん。今日は、校内の案内を……\nって、ちょっと！　どこに行くの？", "zh": "啊，那个，紬……小姐。今天要带你参观校园……\n等等，等一下！你要去哪儿？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0189_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0189_story_02_1004_051tmg", "source_sha256": "dacaeca74c0bfd909297098529619afb439d91e129524ec2cb3b10930d6488ef", "ja": "私でしたら、もうおかまいなく。\n学園内のことは、ある程度わかっていますので。", "zh": "我的话，不用费心了。\n学园里的事，我已经了解得差不多了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0189_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0189_story_02_1005_049mom", "source_sha256": "ad6b88e72b3ceb57c87e1e78a8fb8062c7f9f206a3865145a0d2ba0e3d5a4109", "ja": "でも私には、クラス委員としての責任が……\nだ、だから、話の途中でしょ！　待ちなさ……あっ！", "zh": "可是，我作为班级委员，还有责任……\n所、所以，都说了还没说完嘛！给我等一下……啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0189_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0189_story_02_1006_052kao", "source_sha256": "b68353c1845b70f5a80d886ce07a71e3fe023408ea0d5f4bcf5f318fc167368d", "ja": "あら。桃子さん、ごきげんよう。今出て行ったのは、\n紬さん……？　何かあったのかしら？", "zh": "哎呀。桃子，你好。刚才跑出去的是\n紬吗……？是发生什么事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0189_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0189_story_02_1007_049mom", "source_sha256": "7ae38fae1452a9810333de2f3acc4e59575034931771465a0b5af9e0eaf7e734", "ja": "い、いえっ！　何でもありませんわ、シスター歌織！\nお、オホホホホ……。", "zh": "没、没有！什么事都没有哦，歌织修女！\n哦、哦呵呵呵呵……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0189_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0189_story_02_1008_tsumugi2", "source_sha256": "cc937f32d92584be98bdfd3eab2a6b46bc2ca3536c89b88c43d6ae1bcfe7e438", "ja": "（つん）", "zh": "（戳）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0189_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0189_story_02_1009_049mom", "source_sha256": "c688a67fe38e1b707c70d3f2f3ab90c7c1def7fcfe207a24b959138aa08715e3", "ja": "ぐぬぬ……！", "zh": "唔唔唔……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0189_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0189_story_02_1010_049mom", "source_sha256": "92ff1c10cedc974c7b03d58a7ba59859900d9d8abd67accb489240ec3c8faf29", "ja": "もう！　あの人、休み時間の度にどっか行っちゃうし。\n結局、放課後になっちゃったじゃないの……はぁ。", "zh": "真是的！那个人每到休息时间就不知道跑去哪了。\n结果不都拖到放学了吗……唉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0189_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0189_story_02_1011_011ami", "source_sha256": "f442ffc34f71831977ca4cca8e4c70f287c782c12a0c936835c11c093e89cf62", "ja": "さすがの桃子さんも、苦戦してるみたいだね～。\nこういう時に頼りになるのは……あ、ウワサをすれば！", "zh": "连桃子好像也遇到难题了呢～  \n这种时候能派上用场的是……啊，说曹操曹操到！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0189_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0189_story_02_1012_039kon", "source_sha256": "517ca030fbdb917c9f1227d072a18467a39e0cfe9b12895c1237fac31d7f2ee9", "ja": "ごきげんよう、桃子さん、亜美さん。\nちょっといいかしら？", "zh": "祝你安好，桃子、亚美。方便打扰一下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0189_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0189_story_02_1013_049mom", "source_sha256": "aaf19c1fc3bf828525b80bd41e9fb1fb025fde8a204986826865ff5f5bc68489", "ja": "あら、このみさん。\n広報部の活動に行ったんじゃなかったの？", "zh": "哎呀，木实小姐。\n你不是去参加宣传部的活动了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0189_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0189_story_02_1014_039kon", "source_sha256": "f750c258301aa5a1ca135f6788d1e0b41bc7b07f956d2e854d76afcb71827824", "ja": "ええ、そうなんだけど……白石紬さんについて、\n私のお姉さまから気になる話を聞いて、戻ってきたの。", "zh": "是的，没错……不过，我从姐姐那里听到了一些关于白石紬小姐的在意的事情，所以就回来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0189_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0189_story_02_1015_049mom", "source_sha256": "656d01b93caa16ffd810f4b09d767676f4f3bde98df580fcb49d8db4512555e6", "ja": "このみさんのお姉さま……\nミス・パンジーの、横山奈緒さん？", "zh": "昴小姐的姐姐……\n就是那位紫罗兰小姐，横山奈绪？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0189_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0189_story_02_1016_039kon", "source_sha256": "42e398da70381d0112979bcf13be6bcb5375162ff932bd35f89b3c4b0786deb6", "ja": "ええ。卒業した、先代のミス・アルメリアの話のこと。\n……実は彼女には、妹候補がふたりいたらしいの。", "zh": "嗯。是关于那位已经毕业的、上一代紫罗兰小姐的事。\n……听说，她其实有两个候选妹妹。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0189_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0189_story_02_1017_039kon", "source_sha256": "734f3c4095ff3b9078d017ceca4145975418f0bf966b885f6dfafb8568945386", "ja": "それが、美奈子さんと、あの紬さんなんですって。", "zh": "听说那两个人就是美奈子小姐和那位纺小姐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0189_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0189_story_02_1018_011ami", "source_sha256": "75f9b36d3d6f9fdcf72cdc8c05906285f80adcadbabdf7bc89dd10df75c76dca", "ja": "えーっ！？　じゃあ美奈子さんじゃなくて、紬さんが\nミス・アルメリアだったかもしれないってこと！？", "zh": "诶——！？那也就是说，不是美奈子，而是紬小姐也有可能是阿尔梅利亚小姐！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0189_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0189_story_02_1019_039kon", "source_sha256": "5a65427a4c6e9503b41c4d203cbcd9ab1df917189bfdcdd07a1df87f6a598a77", "ja": "その辺りの事情は、よくわからないけど……紬さんが\n病気で休学された後、美奈子さんが妹になったそうよ。", "zh": "那方面的情况，我也不太清楚……听说在紬因为生病休学后，美奈子就成了妹妹。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0189_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0189_story_02_1020_049mom", "source_sha256": "500f1c444a5c8512bf0c6575fcd68c0fe1ed7b957bfcffa33dcd62459754cf45", "ja": "そんな……。", "zh": "怎么会这样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0189_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0189_story_02_1021_039kon", "source_sha256": "372bb52a48e3190cb96afe62703caa6154b704cd66c94bf6da97bd64719225df", "ja": "あ！　それと、もうひとつ……。", "zh": "啊！还有，另外一件事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0189_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0189_story_02_1022_019min", "source_sha256": "b0160f693483d908bc96ee7123ac0ad868392d41b65cf56cf1b2ffeca41a721f", "ja": "多くつきすぎた蕾を、すこし取り除いて……と。\n摘蕾は、これくらいでいいかな。", "zh": "把结得太多的花蕾稍微摘掉一些……好。\n疏蕾差不多这样就可以了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0189_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0189_story_02_1023_020meg", "source_sha256": "d012d9f0423ee3bcc5af940c29909186b7b6fa3d93a122c0eece34cb7829a70d", "ja": "せっかく蕾がついたのに、摘んじゃうんですか？\n美奈子お姉さま。", "zh": "好不容易长出了花蕾，却要摘掉吗？\n美奈子姐姐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0189_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0189_story_02_1024_019min", "source_sha256": "8b782d5fe1b4d76306a8beee891c90a34fae4233f46fca282826e1e7bbdd1dc0", "ja": "そう。蕾がつきすぎると、栄養が行き渡らなくて、\n元気なお花が咲かなくなっちゃうから。", "zh": "对。花蕾长得太多的话，营养就没法充分输送过去，也就开不出精神饱满的花了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0189_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0189_story_02_1025_019min", "source_sha256": "3572c1eb5a99bcacdf3b8c856dd3c0bd198a7ed172826cd7b7145a8c776114e8", "ja": "だから、こうして数を減らすんだけど……\n恵美ちゃんも、なんだか元気がないみたいだね？", "zh": "所以才要像这样减少花蕾的数量，不过……惠美好像也有点没精神呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0189_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0189_story_02_1026_019min", "source_sha256": "fd81aac0fab6a66cd4bb4662c462ff827e4942599e5493eee3a776ec59502100", "ja": "何か悩んでるなら、相談してほしいな。\n私は、恵美ちゃんのお姉さまなんだから。", "zh": "有什么烦恼的话，就来跟我商量吧。我可是惠美的姐姐呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0189_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0189_story_02_1027_020meg", "source_sha256": "4e0da3d2fe698c8ec2aa65615b32bad17e613ff901482aed2aadad76d98ef444", "ja": "はぁ……やっぱ、美奈子お姉さまには敵わないな～。\n次の生徒会選挙のことで、ちょっと……。", "zh": "唉……果然还是比不上美奈子姐姐啊～  \n是关于下次学生会选举的事，有点……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0189_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0189_story_02_1028_019min", "source_sha256": "521813569172e0a760f3ac5c44734a1d0219d988c31f6adbc962e72152299340", "ja": "選挙……そっか、もうそんな時期なんだね。私は\n生徒会のお仕事、恵美ちゃんに向いてると思うけど……", "zh": "选举……这样啊，已经到那个时候了呢。我觉得学生会的工作很适合惠美哦，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0189_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0189_story_02_1029_019min", "source_sha256": "1da86d170d8479829f81e2aea13a6f1f9df5b7f4d1a034facda4747bf46ae069", "ja": "どんな決断をしても、私は恵美ちゃんを応援するよ。\nだって、私の自慢の妹だからね♪", "zh": "无论惠美做出什么决定，我都会支持她。\n因为她可是我引以为傲的妹妹呀♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0189_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0189_story_02_1030_020meg", "source_sha256": "04fe4ba63c9b7ac54823b413998eaa1439e7cdb38af2da2358440572fc8c5c74", "ja": "美奈子お姉さま……。", "zh": "美奈子姐姐……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0189_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0189_story_02_1031_se", "source_sha256": "4ddae2b15490af7983897e7b8521f0ad2fd1d2dc36541cb859e6305538e2aa88", "ja": "ガサッ……", "zh": "沙沙……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0189_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0189_story_02_1032_051tmg", "source_sha256": "80508c901fcdebe1d3a100fb41c1678711a58eacfba8e1663518703c93c10b31", "ja": "自慢の妹、ですか。あなたの口から、そんな言葉を\n聞く日が来るとは、思ってもみませんでした。", "zh": "自豪的妹妹吗？没想到有一天，竟然能从你口中听到这样的话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0189_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0189_story_02_1033_019min", "source_sha256": "b6a562d86bdfc261c324e679ddede636e2708b50f577b55a9466409ada4b3194", "ja": "！！　つ、紬ちゃん……？", "zh": "！！纺、纺织……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0189_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0189_story_02_1034_020meg", "source_sha256": "92cb755475dbc5b487df906e427d2355de68f5b41c1f12207475d8d219803f39", "ja": "紬……ちゃん？", "zh": "䌷……䌷？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0189_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0189_story_02_1035_051tmg", "source_sha256": "dba10f92c6386cfce25033a5124b5672651fd75db08c36a27cb87024b43f5b05", "ja": "残念ながら、幽霊ではありませんよ。\n今日は、あなたに伝えたいことがあって参りました。", "zh": "很遗憾，我并不是幽灵。\n今天是有件想告诉您的事，所以才来到了这里。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0189_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0189_story_02_1036_019min", "source_sha256": "e91ec8221edf977ceca45a5be5cfda81a3ff1fd2527b985622d1b281c0392d73", "ja": "伝えたいこと……？", "zh": "想告诉我的事……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
